  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "1. What happens now"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "When the Parts Velocity report is downloaded as a PDF, the long text columns are printed in full instead of being shortened. A description that runs to over a hundred characters is printed complete and simply wraps onto several lines inside its cell, which makes the rows very tall and the page hard to read."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "2. What should happen instead"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The written description asks for those three columns to be shortened in the PDF."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Parts Velocity specification, version 5, requirement S6-R6: \"The PDF is formatted for A3 landscape, titled Parts Velocity. In the PDF, Description, Category, and Vendor are truncated to 18 characters. Part # is not truncated. The CSV carries the full, untruncated Description / Category / Vendor values.\""
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "3. How to see it"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Sign in as a user who can see reports and open "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Reports",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " > "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Parts Velocity",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "In the report's own search box type "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "179.YK5005",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the three-dot menu at the top of the report and choose "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Download (PDF)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the downloaded file and look at the Description and Category columns."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Exact test data this was seen with:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " part number "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "179.YK5005",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ", description "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "CLEVIS KIT MERITOR TYPE 5/8\"Straight, 5/8in-18 Threads, 1/2in and 1/4in Pins, Pin C to C is 1-3/8in(E11430A, R810019)",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " (117 characters), category "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "HD-Air Brakes & Air Suspension",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " (30 characters), vendor "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Iview Commercial",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ", locations "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Staging Heavy Duty - 9919",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " and "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ", date range "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "This Year",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "4. What was actually in the file"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The PDF row printed the whole description and the whole category:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "{noquote}"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Inventory 179.YK5005 CLEVIS KIT MERITOR TYPE 5/8\"Straight, 5/8in-18 Threads, 1/2in and 1/4in Pins, Pin C to C is 1-3/8in(E11430A, R810019) HD-Air Brakes & Air Suspension Iview Commercial Staging Lethbridge - 4310 7.00 $5.18 $11.26 $78.82 $42.56 54.0% 8 72 days 43.00"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "{noquote}"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Shortened to eighteen characters the description would have read "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "CLEVIS KIT MERITOR",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " and the category "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "HD-Air Brakes & Ai",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "5. What was ruled out"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "It is not a reading problem in the file.",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " A second, much shorter part was downloaded the same way and its description, "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Brake & Parts Cleaner",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " (21 characters), was also printed in full - so nothing at all is being shortened, not just the very long one."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "It is not the spreadsheet.",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " The spreadsheet is supposed to carry the full text and it does. Only the PDF is wrong."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "It is not the Part # column.",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " Part # is correctly left alone, which is what the written description asks for."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "It is not the page size.",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " The PDF is correctly A3 landscape and correctly titled "
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Parts Velocity",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ", and the shop logo is printed."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "6. How often"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every time. Three PDF downloads out of three, on three different searches."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "7. Where it was seen"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Reports > Parts Velocity, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " "
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Parts Velocity report specification, version 5, requirement S6-R6, which says: \"The PDF is formatted for A3 landscape, titled Parts Velocity. In the PDF, Description, Category, and Vendor are truncated to 18 characters. Part # is not truncated. The CSV carries the full, untruncated Description / Category / Vendor values.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
